<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Converse started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Converse started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs said it initiated coverage of Converse Inc with a market outperform rating.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Converse gained 1-5/8 to 22.</p>
</text>
